B.acP=new A.dS("      Rotate [this] (in place) to a different orientation (any of the four 90-degree rotations).\n\n      This action does not involve moving to a different zone; the card stays in place and only changes its facing.\n      ",!0)
B.kw=new A.d_("Reorient","Rotate [this] (in place) to a different orientation.",null,!1,null,0,"reorient")
B.pk=new A.d_("Transform",'When the transform condition is met, you must immediately resolve: "Sac [this]: you can summon from your [[Fables Deck]] a [Transformed] creature."',null,!1,B.L,14,"transform")
B.acF=s(["This action is only available for equipments.","See [[Equipment]] for a full explanation of this action."],t.s)
B.pl=new A.d_("Equip","Attach [this] to target creature.",null,!1,null,4,"equip")
B.acS=new A.dS("      Target a creature zone (other than the one the attacking creature is in). Typically, a player will target their\n      opponent's zones for attacking.\n\n      Then, the Blocker (if any) must be determined; following these rules:\n\n      - If the targeted zone has a creature, that creature _must_ block the attack (except if it has [[Fading]]).\n\n      - If not, if the attacking creature has [[Evasive]], it cannot be blocked and this will be a direct attack.\n\n      - If not, if the controller of the zone has a creature that can target the zone, they can optionally select one\n        such creature to block the attack.\n\n      - If they chose not to or can't, the other player has a choice to block as well.\n\n      - If not, creature is attacking the controller of the zone directly.\n\n      **Note**: normally it is expected that each player only attack opponent zones, and similarly only block their own\n      zones; but the rules allow any interaction for full flexibility.\n\n      After the blocker (or lack thereof) is established, the **Strike Action** is added to the chain to be resolved.\n\n      For blocked attacks, the two creatures [[Fight | fight]]; during a [[Battle Event]], the attacker has\n      [[Fight | First Strike]] against active blockers.\n\n      For direct attacks, regardless of the [[Might | Might Stat]] of the creature (as long as it is greater than 0), the\n      controller of the zone loses 1 [[HP]] and [[Draw | draws]] a card.\n\n      **Note**: a creature cannot attack or be blocked by itself, even if it is moved before the attack resolves. It\n      can however certain attack and block allied cards.\n\n      **Note**: blocking is _not_ an Action, but rather considered part of the [[Strike]] action itself.\n      ",!0)
B.i0=new A.d_("Strike","Target creature zone to fight with blocker or deal direct damage.",null,!1,null,2,"strike")
B.pm=new A.d_("Sidestep","Move a card to an empty adjacent zone (either conquered or unconquered), rotating to desired orientation.","Move to an empty adjacent zone.",!0,null,12,"sidestep")
B.acT=new A.dS('      Target a different empty, conquered creature zone you control: move [this] to it, and then, optionally, rotate it\n      to a different orientation.\n\n      The destination zone must be a different zone from the one the creature is currently in, and must be targeted\n      beforehand, but the final rotation can be chosen at resolution.\n\n      A card can "jump over" other cards like a chess Knight to move; but it cannot move to an occupied zone.\n\n      Creatures with [[Explorer]] can target any (conquered or non-conquered) zones to move regardless of their arrows.\n      ',!0)
B.kx=new A.d_("March","Move to target empty, [[Conquered | conquered]] creature zone you control, rotating to desired orientation.",null,!1,null,1,"march")
B.acK=s(["The Creature Token must always be face-up (you can choose the orientation).","If the zone is no longer empty when this effect resolves: it fizzles."],t.s)
B.pn=new A.d_("Conscript","Summon a [[Creature Token]] to target empty conquered creature zone.",null,!1,null,5,"conscript")
B.po=new A.d_("Cleanse","Clear all conditions from a card.","Clear all conditions.",!0,null,13,"cleanse")
B.pp=new A.d_("Shift","Swap [this] with target card of the same type you control.",null,!1,null,11,"shift")
B.acM=s(["You _can_ switch them.","You _can_ re-organize face-down artifacts. This action does _not_ target."],t.s)
B.pq=new A.d_("Maneuver","Re-organize any number of connected artifacts you control into any number of your connected artifact zones you own.",null,!1,B.fp,7,"maneuver")
B.acH=s(["Only when the zone [this] card is in is attacked. This effect is not relevant to Active Blocking.","If you choose to fade; the [Strike] becomes a direct attack and cannot be blocked by any other creature."],t.s)
B.aco=new A.QA()
